{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:size:helperText:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/defaultSize"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"],"title":"Enumerations","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCircularProgressIndicatorV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Variants","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Variants"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value in ","type":"text"},{"code":"[0, 1]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Values outside this range are coerced.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"text":": no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Statuses","anchor":"Statuses"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Track","anchor":"Track","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" to the target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":". When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are always disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" flag."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Helper text","anchor":"Helper-text","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional text displayed below the circular indicator to provide context or additional information."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The helper text is always centered under the indicator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"},{"type":"text","text":" which offers two variants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description. The percentage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value and its ","type":"text"},{"code":"%","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"75%\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in English, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"75 %\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in French, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"٪75\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in Arabic).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is a simple "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with percentage and description","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  helperText: .percent(\"of 100 MB\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info, helperText: \"Processing...\")"]},{"level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that assistive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"technologies know the value is changing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic ","type":"text"},{"code":".isStaticText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trait is used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver (","type":"text"},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — and therefore","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Colored surfaces","anchor":"Colored-surfaces","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading"},{"level":3,"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"status","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents27OUDSProgressIndicatorStatusO","text":"OUDSProgressIndicatorStatus","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"track","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gapSize","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents28OUDSProgressIndicatorGapSizeO","text":"OUDSProgressIndicatorGapSize","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"size","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14CoreFoundation7CGFloatV","text":"CGFloat","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"helperText","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?)","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Creates an ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" circular progress indicator.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator\/init(status:track:gapsize:size:helpertext:)","title":"init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:)","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSComponents/do